  {
   "img": "https://assets.forge-vtt.com/bazaar/systems/pf2e/assets/icons/spells/impeccable-flow.webp",
   "name": "Impeccable Flow",
   "system": {
    "description": {
     "gm": "",
     "value": "<p>You attune yourself to an underlying cosmic order to the world. While you remain in tune with this power, you gain a +1 status bonus to Perception checks, saving throws, and skill checks. If you critically fail any check while under the effects of this spell, the bonus ends and you instead have a -1 status penalty to all checks for the remaining duration.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.slI9P4jUp3ERPCqX]{Spell Effect: Impeccable Flow}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.F10ofwC0k1ELIaV4]{Spell Effect: Impeccable Flow (Critical Failure Effect)}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The status bonus increases to +2.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> The status bonus increases to +3.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Note: The automation for the critical failure effect defaults to 10 rounds and must be altered manually.</em></p>"
    },
    "rules": [],
    "slug": "impeccable-flow",
