   "name": "Admonishing Ray",
   "system": {
    "description": {
     "gm": "",
     "value": "<p>A ray of energy bludgeons your target into submission without causing lasting harm. When you cast this spell, you choose whether the ray feels like a strong punch or slap. Make a spell attack roll. The ray deals 2d6 bludgeoning damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
